This licence covers this repository's own source code and documentation:
the three modules' ColdFire sources, their manifests and their READMEs. It
does not extend to any Elektron Music Machines firmware, which is not
distributed here and remains the property of its copyright holder; every
image is built by the user from their own copy of the official OS with
octabam (https://github.com/sambanks/octabam, MIT, Sam Banks), whose build
system these manifests are written for. The displaced stock instructions a
hook site replays (a few bytes per site) are carried the way every octabam
ColdFire module carries them. Nothing in this project is endorsed by,
supported by or affiliated with Elektron. Octatrack and Elektron are
trademarks of Elektron Music Machines MAV AB, used only to identify the
hardware this project targets.

---

The FM SYNTH machine-list chooser -- synth/machine.s and the chooser's parts of
synth/poly.s, synth/page.s and quantizer/quantizer.s -- is adapted from
Modwerk's FM Synth module (https://github.com/repeat98/modwerk,
sdk/octabam/modules/synth, commit 1c1d938), whose chooser is derived from
Modwerk's Analog BD chooser hooks. Their notices, as that module's LICENSE
carries them:

Dedicated chooser, Part validation, sample-free transport and original presentation:

